{"title":"Combined feed","url":"https://Vinnl.github.io/feeds/all.xml","elements":[{"title":"a Boston literary landmark (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that <b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Old_Corner_Bookstore\" title=\"Old Corner Bookstore\">a Boston literary landmark</a></b> <i>(pictured)</i> became a fast-food restaurant?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Old_Corner_Bookstore","retrieved":1785830480310},{"title":"Julien Thoulet (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that French oceanographer <b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Julien_Thoulet\" title=\"Julien Thoulet\">Julien Thoulet</a></b> felt that the <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/General_Bathymetric_Chart_of_the_Oceans\" title=\"General Bathymetric Chart of the Oceans\">General Bathymetric Chart of the Oceans</a> would \"tend towards perfection\" but would \"never be completed\"?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Julien_Thoulet","retrieved":1785830480311},{"title":"Military Theory and Practice in the Age of Xenophon (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that <i><b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Military_Theory_and_Practice_in_the_Age_of_Xenophon\" title=\"Military Theory and Practice in the Age of Xenophon\">Military Theory and Practice in the Age of Xenophon</a></b></i> helped to revive the study of ancient Greek warfare in the United States?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Military_Theory_and_Practice_in_the_Age_of_Xenophon","retrieved":1785830480313},{"title":"Detective Barbie (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that <b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Detective_Barbie_in_the_Mystery_of_the_Carnival_Caper\" title=\"Detective Barbie in the Mystery of the Carnival Caper\">Detective Barbie</a></b> could say 50,000 different player names in 1998?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Detective_Barbie_in_the_Mystery_of_the_Carnival_Caper","retrieved":1785830480314},{"title":"flag of Samoa (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that the colours and design elements of the <b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Flag_of_Samoa\" title=\"Flag of Samoa\">flag of Samoa</a></b>, including the Southern Cross, are derived from the flag of New Zealand?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Flag_of_Samoa","retrieved":1785830480316},{"title":"Thomas N. Armstrong III (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that <b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Thomas_N._Armstrong_III\" title=\"Thomas N. Armstrong III\">Thomas N. Armstrong<span typeof=\"mw:Entity\">&nbsp;</span>III</a></b> transformed the Whitney Museum of American Art from a \"dowdy repository of unfashionable old art\" into a \"flashy showcase for young hot shots\"?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Thomas_N._Armstrong_III","retrieved":1785830480317},{"title":"their city status (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that Chernobyl and <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pripyat\" title=\"Pripyat\">Pripyat</a> have not lost <b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/City_status_in_Ukraine\" title=\"City status in Ukraine\">their city status</a></b> even though they are abandoned?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/City_status_in_Ukraine","retrieved":1785830480319},{"title":"blunt-leaf sandwort (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that the anthers of the <b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Moehringia_lateriflora\" title=\"Moehringia lateriflora\">blunt-leaf sandwort</a></b> are infected by a species of <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Smut_(fungus)\" title=\"Smut (fungus)\">smut fungus</a>, producing spores that are spread to other flowers by pollinators?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Moehringia_lateriflora","retrieved":1785830480327},{"title":"Jerry Kobasa (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that <b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jerry_Kobasa\" title=\"Jerry Kobasa\">Jerry Kobasa</a></b> was inducted into an Afro-American sports hall of fame despite not being African-American?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jerry_Kobasa","retrieved":1785830480329},{"title":"Destination of the Month (Wikivoyage recommendations)","contents":"<span class=\"mw-empty-elt\" about=\"#mwt8\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\" id=\"mwIQ\" data-mw=\"{&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;banner&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:&quot;./Template:Banner&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;direction&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;left&quot;},&quot;title&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;Des Moines&quot;},&quot;type&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;dotm&quot;},&quot;image&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;DesMoinesBanner1.jpg&quot;},&quot;quote&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;A capitol building with a golden dome, several art institutions and a State Fair each August; these are some of the things awaiting you in Iowa's largest city.&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}\"><style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r4523569\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/templatestyles\" about=\"#mwt9\" data-mw=\"{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Banner/styles.css&quot;}}\">.mw-parser-output .mainpage-shadowbox{color:white;background:rgb(16,16,16);background:rgba(0,0,0,0.3);border-radius:4px}.mw-parser-output .mainpage-shadowbox h2,.mw-parser-output .mainpage-shadowbox h3{color:white;border:none;font-family:sans-serif;line-height:1.2em;margin:0;padding:0}.mw-parser-output .mainpage-shadowbox a{color:white;font-weight:bold}.mw-parser-output .banner-image{position:relative;max-width:1125px;height:auto;margin-bottom:.6em}.mw-parser-output .banner-image img{max-width:100%;height:auto}.mw-parser-output .banner-box-wide{width:80%}.mw-parser-output .banner-box-left,.mw-parser-output .ban